coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder sharing add [flags] <workspace> --user <user>:<role> --group
  <group>:<role>

  Share a workspace with a user or group.

  Aliases: share

  This command fails if workspace sharing is disabled for the deployment, or if
  the organization's sharing policy doesn't allow sharing the workspace. See
  https://coder.com/docs/user-guides/shared-workspaces#policies for sharing
  policies.

OPTIONS:
      --group string-array
          A comma separated list of groups to share the workspace with.

      --user string-array
          A comma separated list of users to share the workspace with.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
